This covers tools/ (tools/fenrir/ is copied from Fenrir; check.py, take.py and report.py were written for this library)
and schema/recipe-1.json.

They are published so that anyone can see exactly how a submitted recipe is checked, and so that this repository's own
GitHub Actions can run those checks. You may read them, and run them to check a recipe for this library. No other right
to use, copy, change or share them is given.

The CC0-1.0 dedication in ../LICENSE covers the recipe data only: recipes/, examples/ and revoked.json.
